**/.git
**/.venv
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/dist-test
**/coverage
# ...but NOT a source directory that happens to be called `coverage`. The
# pattern above targets istanbul/vitest REPORT output at package roots; without
# this negation it also silently drops `legal-search/api/src/modules/coverage/`
# from the build context, and the image build fails with "Cannot find module"
# for files that are present and committed in git. Local gates cannot see it —
# only the container build can.
!**/src/**/coverage
!**/src/**/coverage/**
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/.pytest_cache
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
